\[
T_{p,q}
=
\begin{cases}
0,&p=q,\\
\displaystyle\frac\pi{\omega_p-\omega_q},&p\ne q.
\end{cases}
\]

设 \(C_{p,q}\in\mathbb C\) 且 \(C_{p,p}=0\)。定义：

\[
E_{\mathrm{cal}}(\omega,C)
=
\sum_{p,q}|K_{p,q}(T_{p,q},0)C_{p,q}|^2.
\]

